# CODEOWNERS — maps file paths to the GitHub users or teams responsible for
# reviewing changes. GitHub uses this file to automatically request reviews
# when a pull request touches the matched paths.
#
# Syntax: <pattern>  <@user or @org/team> [<@user or @org/team> ...]
#
# The last matching rule wins. A catch-all entry at the top ensures every PR
# gets at least one reviewer; add more specific rules below to route reviews
# for particular areas to the right people.

